  "notes": "Backlog game, all-AAA pass: picked from RAWG's most-added list for its year across all genres (docs/PLAN.md section 2, genre filter widened 2026-10-23). RAWG's plain \"mortal-kombat-1\" slug is the 1992 game; the 2023 game is \"mortal-kombat-1-2023\" (id 960873), which was the first search result. StrategyWiki has a page for the 2023 game (completion stage 0); it links Chapter 1: A New Era to Chapter 20: Shadow Play, a Walkthrough and character pages, but the only written subpage is \"Table of Contents\", so nothing was used. mortalkombat.fandom.com answers the API with about 306 linked articles, including \"Mortal Kombat 1's Story Mode\", \"Invasion\", \"Towers of Time\", \"Kameo Fighters\" and \"Titans\"; names only were looked at, nothing copied. Steam app 1971870 is \"Mortal Kombat 1\". None of its 50 Steam achievements is hidden. The Talisman, Relic and Konsumable achievements do not name a mode; they have their own chapter. Kombat League and online matches need a network connection."
